# Prisma migration files are checksummed byte-for-byte by `prisma migrate`
# (no line-ending normalization). They MUST check out as LF on every
# platform, or a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) would compute CRLF
# checksums that never match the LF checksums recorded in an existing
# database's _prisma_migrations table, and `prisma migrate deploy` would
# refuse to run against dev/prod. See PHASE-4O.2 report.
/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf
/prisma/migrations/migration_lock.toml text eol=lf
/prisma/schema.prisma text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
